  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>is even</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>is odd</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p>Case-I: If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is even</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>Odd</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>Even</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Case-II: If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is odd</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>Even</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>Odd</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math> (Not possible)</p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Now,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p>"
